  "title": "Thrift: Update dissector internal documentation",
  "description": "The navigation guides at the beginning of the file were obsolete since the introduction of the compact protocol and later improvements. This is fixed in the first part.\n\nMy work to implement the fix in !17300 showed that the difference in return codes between standard dissector and sub-dissectors might lead to confusion. I did attempt to split the error codes in the same way in standard dissector but it resulted in a more convoluted code in several places, reducing the readability so I chose to document in the second part instead of changing the logic.",
